WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,970
My brother is the boss of Jiangnan

2
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:09,970
You all have to listen to me now

3
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:10,970
Send me food right away

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:14,150
He's crazy

5
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,410
It's a miracle he's alive to this day

6
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:20,410
I remember that the first thing Chen Zhenghao robbed was his house.

7
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:24,210
When I went to see a doctor for his grandson Lin Xiaohu

8
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:26,210
feel pity for them

9
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,210
I gave them some supplies

10
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:30,340
The snowstorm had just begun at that time

11
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,340
I thought it would pass soon

12
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,340
Don't blame me

13
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:36,810
That's not the problem

14
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:39,260
The few supplies you gave me

15
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,260
You should have finished eating already

16
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,480
Then what does he rely on to survive until now?

17
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,480
Lin Xiaohu because there is no medicine

18
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,480
He died of illness almost ten days ago
